    <string name="email_setup_title">E-mail notice after a password change</string>
    <string name="email_setup_steps">To get an e-mail after you change your password, set up the free EmailJS service once (about 5 minutes):\n\n1. Create an account at emailjs.com.\n\n2. Email Services > Add New Service > Gmail > Connect. Copy its Service ID.\n\n3. Email Templates > Create New Template. Set To Email to {{to_email}}, Subject to \"Your LOCUS password was changed\", and put {{message}} and {{time}} in the content. Save and copy the Template ID.\n\n4. Account > General: copy your Public Key.\n\n5. Account > Security: turn ON \"Allow EmailJS API for non-browser applications\".\n\n6. Paste the three values below, tap Save, then tap Send test e-mail.</string>
