    <string name="connect_fb_steps">1. Open the Firebase console, create a project (free) and add an Android app with the package name com.locus.app.\n\n2. Build > Authentication > Get started > turn on Email/Password.\n\n3. Build > Firestore Database > Create database. Then open Rules, paste the file firestore.rules from the project and Publish.\n\n4. Project settings > your Android app > download google-services.json to this phone.\n\n5. Tap the button below and choose that file. No rebuild is needed.\n\n6. Log in once with your e-mail and password.</string>
