    <string name="cloud_setup_message">Posts reach other phones only through the cloud. One-time setup (about 10 minutes):\n\n1. Create a Firebase project and add an Android app with the package name com.locus.app.\n2. Put the downloaded google-services.json in the app folder and build the APK again.\n3. Authentication: turn on Email/Password.\n4. Firestore Database: create it, then open Rules, paste the file firestore.rules from the project and Publish.\n5. Install that same APK on every phone and log in.\n\nThe README has the full steps.</string>
